{
  "ruleId": "DED-DONATION-WHOLE",
  "_note": "Donations allowed in full: \"the whole of the aggregate of the sum or the sums paid by the assessee, in the tax year as donations to\" the funds of s.133(1)(a)(i)–(xxii), without limit, and (xxiii) family planning, within s.133(2)'s qualifying limit (pp.167–168) — base AMOUNT_PAID, the sum counted (after the limit where it reaches). (xxiv) is \"by an assessee being a company\" and is not built. Only a sum of money (s.133(4)); the donees' approvals, notifications and a resident's Clean Ganga donation are entry conditions. Old regime only: s.202(2)(a)(xii) excludes Chapter VIII other than ss.124(1), 124(2), 125(2) and 146 (p.227). TY 2026-27 only; the 1961 counterpart, s.80G, is unread (W-075d). rulebook DED-80G-001. D-142.",
